
================================================================================
       Custom Memory Allocator - Educational Implementation in C               
================================================================================

This program demonstrates a simple free-list based memory allocator.

Features:
  - Static 1MB heap buffer
  - First-fit allocation strategy
  - Block splitting to reduce internal fragmentation
  - Coalescing to reduce external fragmentation
  - 8-byte alignment for all allocations


